      "text": "The vault bat swoops downward, Flying once and shrieking with a soul-chilling cry as they do so. This movement doesn't trigger reactions. Any adjacent creature the vault bat passes during its Fly must attempt a DC 28 Will save save or become Frightened 1 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure)."
